# First Notes on String 3 (repertoire plan: st-first-notes-string-3). An original study in G
# major. Bars 1-4: the open string 3 (G) and fret 2 (A) with finger 2, a call and answer over the
# teacher's G and D7 (A sits in D7). Bars 5-8 use strings 3, 2 and 1 together: G, A, B, C, D and
# the open string 1 (E), up the G chord and back down to G.
